# No runtime artifacts in the git repo

Never write screenshots, logs, smoke results, captures, or diagnostics under the project root (`AwdUI-MCP/`).

Use `~/.awdui-mcp/` instead:

| Kind | Path |
|------|------|
| Screenshots | `~/.awdui-mcp/screenshots/` |
| Smoke / diagnostics | `~/.awdui-mcp/diagnostics/` |
| Repository DB + crops | `~/.awdui-mcp/repository.db`, `repository-assets/` |
| Discovery traces | `~/.awdui-mcp/traces/` |

When testing screenshots manually, save to `%TEMP%\awdui_diag\` or `~/.awdui-mcp/diagnostics/`, not the repo.

The MCP launcher sets `cwd` to `~/.awdui-mcp` so relative paths do not pollute the checkout.
